  "story": {
    "title": "Picture Conversations-Opposites",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "The giraffe is tall . The boy is short . The giraffe is taller than the boy. Is there anyone taller than you in your class?",
      "Devi and Raju were asked to read story books by their mother. Devi is happy reading story books. Raju is sad as he does not like reading books. When do you feel happy and when do you feel sad?",
      "The cat runs fast . The elephant runs slow . Do you run fast or do you run slow?",
      "We played hide and seek. It was fun. Raju closed his eyes and counted upto 10. When he opened his eyes, he could not find us. We were all hiding. Can we all play hide and seek? Who wants to close the eyes?"
    ],
    "sentences": [
